# Rename this to io.github.sysdvrwebos.client.yml when submitting to
# webosbrew/apps-repo and replace YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME / REPOSITORY_NAME.
title: SysDVR
iconUri: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/REPOSITORY_NAME/main/webos/icon.png
manifestUrl: https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/REPOSITORY_NAME/releases/latest/download/io.github.sysdvrwebos.client.manifest.json
category: utility
pool: main
description: |
  Native SysDVR client for LG webOS TVs. Streams H.264 video and PCM audio
  from a Nintendo Switch running SysDVR in TCP Bridge mode, with automatic
  LAN discovery, console selection, A/V synchronization, and reconnect after
  sleep/wake or transient transport failures.
